  "description": "High-performance .NET HTTP client. Fast surface (FastClient + FastH2Client) — span-based codec, arena buffers, per-core sharded H/1.1 pool, multiplexed H/2 connections — beats System.Net.Http.HttpClient on latency and allocation across HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2 (h2c and h2 over TLS+ALPN), and concurrent multiplex. Legacy surface (CosmoClient, CosmoHttp3Client, CosmoPipelineClient, CosmoWebSocket) covers cookies, redirects, retries, response cache, decompression, NDJSON, HTTP/3 over QUIC, WebSockets, and pipelining. gRPC framing primitives included.",
